      storyProgression: 270
      relationship: 6
      comment: I have to do something!
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 6
      comment: I'm sorry, Katsuko...
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 5
      comment: I'll fight for you, Katsuko.
