      comment: We really are friends!
    - name: 50
      storyProgression: 50
      relationship: 3
      comment: I love spending time with her.
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 4
      comment: New school year with her!
    - name: 150
      storyProgression: 150
      relationship: 11
      comment: I want to be more than friends... But I know she doesn't feel the
        same.
    - name: 190
      storyProgression: 190
      relationship: 17
      comment: No... Don't leave! I need you!
    - name: 195
      storyProgression: 195
      relationship: 16
      comment: I'm sorry, Arisa. I'm helpless.
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 5
      comment: We'll always be friends, no matter how far apart we are.
